{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-13","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例与整数","englishTitle":"If four numbers be proportional, they will also be proportional alternately.","book":7,"number":13,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.13","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.13/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":13,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-13@raw-4c60684286e0f3f8","contentId":"euclid-7-13","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c60684286e0f3f80dec0acf10b01fe0011d108249aeb9a209814809713c46cc","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-13.statement","euclid-7-13.construction.1","euclid-7-13.proof.1","euclid-7-13.proof.2","euclid-7-13.conclusion","euclid-7-13.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-13.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-13","revisionId":"euclid-7-13@raw-4c60684286e0f3f8","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bee51a00381372c25b1b67922c075104eeecb4ce74605c3b38989a3257d893bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If four numbers be proportional, they will also be proportional alternately."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果四个号码是成比例, 也会是成比例"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-13.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-13","revisionId":"euclid-7-13@raw-4c60684286e0f3f8","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1cefef56783c115a503c24c3b9795e103d42356357d2d831a28ea4da9b7c4888","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the four numbers A, B, C, D be proportional, so that, as A is to B, so is C to D; I say that they will also be proportional alternately, so that, as A is to C, so will B be to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让这四个A,B,C,D是成比例因此,A对B的比等于C对D的比;我说它们也会轮流成为成比例这样,A是C、B会是D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-13.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-13","revisionId":"euclid-7-13@raw-4c60684286e0f3f8","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec871e214792364d2aef8e18a28251ecf45621e1a81b02f63a96bb97ac8e5762","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as A is to B, so is C to D, therefore, whatever part or parts A is of B, the same part or the same parts is C of D also. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A对B的比等于C对D的比,因此,无论哪些部分或部分为A,同一部分或相同部分为D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-13.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-13","revisionId":"euclid-7-13@raw-4c60684286e0f3f8","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a437d83062c9b90c36fb4b661c3448669fe96ce74ba4df721c52e12bef90bdc2","citations":["euclid-7-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, alternately, whatever part or parts A is of C, the same part or the same parts is B of D also. [[VII. 10](/principles/euclid-7-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无论A部分的多少部分为C,同一部分或相同部分为D部分中的B。 [[VII. 10](/principles/euclid-7-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-13.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-13","revisionId":"euclid-7-13@raw-4c60684286e0f3f8","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"773f83fe1b70b9aedd821ffd95e603bb950f4fc0ac51a2b231851f09d3109b4d","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to C, so is B to D. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A对C的比等于B对D的比；A 与 C 之比等于 B 与 D 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-13.source","contentId":"euclid-7-13","revisionId":"euclid-7-13@raw-4c60684286e0f3f8","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6eb0b7a24f8c58863291eef8329eb01bcbbc59ecdea171e7f892a6007095a5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.13/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.13\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-13:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-13.proof.1","euclid-7-13.conclusion"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.13","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.13/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-13:euclid-7-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-13","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-13.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-10